1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,948
Angstrom Signals helps you navigate the crypto and stock markets.

2
00:00:03,998 --> 00:00:08,095
Clear readings, AI guidance and alerts, with a community alongside.

3
00:00:08,145 --> 00:00:10,344
Here's a quick tour of the dashboard.

4
00:00:10,792 --> 00:00:12,863
On the left is the sidebar.

5
00:00:12,913 --> 00:00:17,266
Your account, your communities, notifications, your watchlists, and settings.

6
00:00:17,703 --> 00:00:22,270
A new account gets a short getting-started checklist: five first steps.

7
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:24,945
The day-one videos walk through each of them.

8
00:00:25,387 --> 00:00:27,948
Quick Snapshot is the market at a glance.

9
00:00:27,998 --> 00:00:30,901
Anything unusual today shows up here first.

10
00:00:31,358 --> 00:00:35,818
Tides is the big picture: rates, the dollar, fear, and where money is flowing.

11
00:00:35,868 --> 00:00:38,643
It sets the conditions every asset trades in.

12
00:00:39,094 --> 00:00:42,906
Market sentiment scores the news headlines, for crypto and for stocks,

13
00:00:42,926 --> 00:00:45,581
from minus one hundred to plus one hundred.

14
00:00:46,022 --> 00:00:48,391
The signal tables list your watchlist.

15
00:00:48,441 --> 00:00:51,984
Each asset gets three readings: Trend, Stretch, and Flow.

16
00:00:52,034 --> 00:00:54,851
They describe the market. They don't forecast it.

17
00:00:55,308 --> 00:00:58,104
Click a name to bring that asset into focus.

18
00:00:58,154 --> 00:01:00,673
The sections below the tables follow it.

19
00:01:01,130 --> 00:01:05,201
The interactive chart shows its candles, with the readings drawn over time,

20
00:01:05,221 --> 00:01:06,721
and your own drawings.

21
00:01:08,706 --> 00:01:11,543
Why these readings explains each score in plain words:

22
00:01:11,563 --> 00:01:14,297
what's pushing it, and what's holding it back.

23
00:01:15,001 --> 00:01:17,882
Angstrom Lattice is your research workspace.

24
00:01:17,932 --> 00:01:21,838
Signal Groups and Signal Sets turn signals into your own questions.

25
00:01:21,888 --> 00:01:26,719
Prism Scan checks them across your assets, and Funnels narrow the whole market down,

26
00:01:26,739 --> 00:01:27,905
stage by stage.

27
00:01:31,519 --> 00:01:34,742
The AI Navigator slides out from the right edge.

28
00:01:34,792 --> 00:01:37,353
Ask it anything about what's on your screen.

29
00:01:37,805 --> 00:01:43,033
The arrow above it opens the community: social signals and chat about each asset.

30
00:01:43,470 --> 00:01:45,093
That's the dashboard.

31
00:01:45,143 --> 00:01:46,456
Next, the day-one guides:

32
00:01:46,476 --> 00:01:50,349
add your assets, then build your first Group, Set, scan and funnel.
